# first_mover: P7 could read "first" as the opening member of a series, and P9, P10 and C as the primary source on which other movers depend. The hand-and-staff example in S12 ties both to one per se ordered series, so I count one sense.
# some_motion: S2 means motion evident to the senses and S4 defines motion broadly as any change from potentiality to actuality. Sensible motion is a case of that broader sense, so I count one.
